00:14:06.660 --> 00:14:08.760
It’s strictly non-commercial.
I’m not selling anything.

00:14:09.420 --> 00:14:12.660
I just put it up as a public service,
as a labor of love,

00:14:12.660 --> 00:14:14.940
as a tribute to
my grandmother,

00:14:14.940 --> 00:14:19.166
whose own life was saved
with evidence-based nutrition.

